<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-dorudon-atrox-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Dorudon atrox Turing wavelength at 253 µm, Priabonian 37.0 Ma (pass 1) — Morphological realism / specimen match: 78/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The pass-1 GIF is a 12-frame 640×480 growth of J0(k r) in the plate's lavender chromaticity. Computer-vision similarity of the last frame to the gallery plate was 85.8, and 85.5 against the Wadi El-Hitan fossil photograph. The comparison figure places the plate beside the last frame, but there is no radial-profile overlay, so the match is visual rather than a reported residual. The plate is not fossil skin." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
